DO $gazpacho$
DECLARE
 j constant jsonb := $records$[{"id":"6f5ad062-368f-4c0a-b615-ae563017fec4","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","public_path":"/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/","language":"es","title":"Gazpacho tradicional español con hortalizas y pan","excerpt":"Gazpacho frío de tomate con pepino, pimiento y pan: cantidades agrupadas, guarnición incluida, enfriado completo y nutrición estimada con fichas USDA.","summary":"Gazpacho frío de tomate y hortalizas crudas, pan remojado, aceite de oliva y vinagre de vino tinto, sin cocción ni colado. Se proponen 4 raciones con guarnición tomada de las verduras medidas y 145 minutos completos, incluidos 120 de enfriado; cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos pendientes de ensayo.","category":"Sopas y cremas","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Sopa fría","cuisine":"Española","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"tomate rojo maduro crudo, peso sin pedúnculo","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Hortalizas"},{"name":"pepino crudo con piel, lavado y sin extremos","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Hortalizas"},{"name":"pimiento verde dulce, sin tallo ni semillas","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Hortalizas"},{"name":"cebolla pelada","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Hortalizas"},{"name":"ajo pelado","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Hortalizas"},{"name":"pan blanco ya horneado, sin relleno ni moho","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base y aliño"},{"name":"aceite de oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base y aliño"},{"name":"vinagre de vino tinto","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Base y aliño"},{"name":"agua potable fría","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Base y aliño"},{"name":"sal fina","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Base y aliño"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava, revisa y pesa las hortalizas","content":"Lávate las manos y prepara tabla, cuchillo, cuenco, báscula y batidora limpios, separados de utensilios de carne o huevo crudos. Lava tomates, pepino y pimiento bajo agua corriente, sin jabón; frota el pepino y seca con un paño limpio antes de cortar. Desecha las piezas podridas. Retira pedúnculos y extremos; al pimiento quítale tallo y semillas. Pesa después 800 g de tomate, 150 g de pepino con piel, 100 g de pimiento, 40 g de cebolla pelada y 4 g de ajo pelado. La receta se consume cruda: lavar no esteriliza.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Lava, revisa y pesa las hortalizas"},{"title":"Remoja el pan y reserva la guarnición","content":"Trocea los 40 g de pan ya horneado en un cuenco y vierte los 120 g de agua fría. Deja ablandar 10 minutos; conserva toda el agua. Mientras tanto, corta y reserva en un recipiente tapado 40 g del tomate, 20 g del pepino y 20 g del pimiento en dados pequeños para servir. Refrigera esa guarnición a 4 °C o menos. Trocea para la batidora los 760 g de tomate, 130 g de pepino y 80 g de pimiento restantes, junto con la cebolla y el ajo. El remojo se solapa con el corte; no se suma de nuevo al tiempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Remoja el pan y reserva la guarnición"},{"title":"Tritura la base sin colar","content":"Coloca en el vaso los 760 g de tomate, 130 g de pepino y 80 g de pimiento de la base, los 40 g de cebolla, los 4 g de ajo y todo el pan con su agua de remojo. Añade los 20 g de vinagre y los 4 g de sal. Tapa y tritura unos 2 minutos, o hasta que no queden trozos grandes; respeta la capacidad máxima del aparato y trabaja por tandas si es necesario. Detén y desenchufa antes de bajar restos con una espátula. No retires pieles o semillas del tomate ni cueles después: esta fórmula las conserva.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Tritura la base sin colar"},{"title":"Emulsiona con el aceite medido","content":"Con la base ya triturada, incorpora los 40 g de aceite de oliva y bate alrededor de 1 minuto más hasta obtener una mezcla uniforme y ligeramente cremosa. Sigue las instrucciones del aparato; si no permite añadir aceite en marcha, detén, añade, tapa y vuelve a triturar. No añadas aceite, agua, hielo ni pan fuera de las cantidades. Para esta propuesta se mantienen la textura y el aliño medidos; cambios posteriores necesitan anotarse y recalcular la nutrición.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Emulsiona con el aceite medido"},{"title":"Enfría enseguida con la guarnición aparte","content":"Pasa todo el gazpacho a recipientes limpios de poca profundidad, tápalos y refrigera enseguida a 4 °C o menos. Enfría como referencia 120 minutos, hasta que toda la mezcla esté bien fría; prolonga si lo necesita y añade ese tiempo al total. Conserva la guarnición también tapada y refrigerada. El vinagre no sustituye la refrigeración ni hace segura una mezcla mal conservada. No enfríes la sopa dejándola primero sobre la encimera.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Enfría enseguida con la guarnición aparte"},{"title":"Remueve y reparte sin añadir ingredientes","content":"Saca el gazpacho solo al servir y remueve con una cuchara limpia para volver a unir posibles capas. Reparte toda la sopa en 4 cuencos iguales. Divide la guarnición medida en 4 partes, cada una con 10 g de tomate, 5 g de pepino y 5 g de pimiento, y colócala encima. No añadas chorros de aceite, pan, huevo ni hierbas extra: no forman parte de esta fórmula. Mantén las porciones que no se consuman de inmediato en frío.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Remueve y reparte sin añadir ingredientes"},{"title":"Sirve frío y conserva lo restante","content":"Sirve una de las 4 porciones por persona. La propuesta completa necesita 145 minutos: 25 de preparación, que incluyen el remojo de 10 mientras se cortan verduras, y 120 de enfriado; no hay cocción. La suma de ingredientes es 1418 g crudos, no un peso final medido; rendimiento y tiempos están pendientes de prueba de cocina. Como propuesta doméstica de calidad sin ensayo, consume preferentemente el mismo día o dentro de 24 horas, siempre tapado a 4 °C o menos, sin volver a mezclar restos del plato con el recipiente.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional: Sirve frío y conserva lo restante"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"tomate rojo maduro crudo","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pepino crudo con piel","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimiento verde dulce crudo sin tallo ni semillas","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla cruda pelada","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ajo crudo pelado","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pan blanco comercial sin relleno","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de oliva","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinagre de vino tinto","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"agua potable","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fina","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Una cuarta parte de sopa y guarnición medidas; sin peso final confirmado","method":"Suma nutrientes de 800 g de tomate, 150 g de pepino con piel, 100 g de pimiento verde, 40 g de cebolla, 4 g de ajo, 40 g de pan, 40 g de aceite, 20 g de vinagre de vino tinto, 120 g de agua y 4 g de sal; divide entre 4. La guarnición sale de estas cantidades, no se suma aparte. No se cuela ni se inventan pérdidas.","note":"Estimación de formulación, no análisis de laboratorio ni resultado de cocina. Diez fichas USDA SR Legacy exactas con ocho nutrientes presentes, sin reemplazar ausencias por cero. Incluye piel de pepino, toda la harina del pan, piel y semillas del tomate y todo el aliño; variaciones de marca, restos y rendimiento cambian los valores. Los 1418 g son suma de ingredientes, no peso final medido."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Gazpacho frío anaranjado rojizo en un cuenco blanco, con pequeños dados de tomate, pepino con piel y pimiento verde"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["gazpacho tradicional","gazpacho español","sopa fría de tomate","gazpacho con pan"],"notes":"Propuesta original de gazpacho frío de tomate, pepino con piel, pimiento verde, cebolla, ajo, pan, aceite y vinagre de vino tinto. Cantidades, cuatro porciones, textura y tiempos pendientes de prueba de cocina; no se afirma ensayo ni peso final. Conserva piel y semillas del tomate y toda el agua del pan; no cuela, por lo que no inventa pérdidas de nutrientes. La guarnición procede de las mismas hortalizas pesadas y no añade aceite ni pan extra. Usa tomates maduros en buen estado y pan ya horneado sin relleno; si tiene moho, descarta el pan, no recortes solo la zona. El tomate puede variar en acidez, agua y dulzor. Para cambiar la textura, anota cualquier agua extra y revisa rendimiento; para sustituir vinagre de vino tinto por Jerez, identifica la etiqueta y recalcula, sin suponer que son la misma ficha USDA. Omitir el pan o usar pan sin gluten cambia la fórmula y nutrición, sin prometer textura equivalente. Contiene trigo/gluten; revisa también leche, huevo o trazas según el pan y sulfitos según el vinagre. Lava produce bajo agua corriente sin jabón antes de cortar, limpia manos y utensilios, y evita contaminación cruzada con carnes o huevos crudos. Es una sopa de hortalizas crudas, no pasteurizada; el lavado reduce suciedad pero no elimina todos los microorganismos y el vinagre no es una garantía de seguridad. Refrigera enseguida a 4 °C o menos. Como propuesta doméstica de calidad no ensayada, consume el mismo día o dentro de 24 horas con cadena de frío continua; conserva sopa y guarnición por separado y usa utensilios limpios. No reutilices restos del plato ni prolongues conservación por olor agradable. Congelar puede separar la emulsión y alterar las hortalizas; no se establece aquí una conservación congelada verificada. Nutrición estimada con diez alimentos USDA exactos, toda la fórmula y guarnición divididas entre cuatro; marca del pan, aceite, vinagre y medición real cambian las cifras.","seo":{"title":"Gazpacho tradicional español: receta paso a paso","description":"Gazpacho frío con tomate, pepino, pimiento y pan. Guarnición medida, tiempos de enfriado completos y nutrición estimada; cantidades propuestas sin ensayo.","image_alt":"Gazpacho frío anaranjado rojizo en un cuenco blanco, con pequeños dados de tomate, pepino con piel y pimiento verde","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Hay que colarlo o pelar todas las verduras?","a":"Esta fórmula conserva piel y semillas del tomate y la piel lavada del pepino. Tritura bien y no cuela; así la estimación cuenta toda la parte comestible pesada. Si decides retirar sólidos, cambia rendimiento y nutrición y debe registrarse, no suponerse una pérdida concreta."},{"q":"¿La guarnición y el aceite se suman aparte?","a":"No. Reserva 40 g de tomate, 20 g de pepino y 20 g de pimiento de las cantidades totales; divide entre 4 para servir. Los 40 g de aceite van a la sopa y no se propone un chorro extra. El pan se remoja con los 120 g de agua, que también se conservan."},{"q":"¿Cuánto tarda y cuánto dura en frío?","a":"Se proponen 145 minutos, 25 de preparación y 120 de enfriado; prolonga si aún no está frío. No hay cocción ni prueba de cocina confirmada. Refrigera de inmediato a 4 °C o menos y, como propuesta doméstica de calidad no verificada, consume el mismo día o dentro de 24 horas; el vinagre no sustituye la cadena de frío."}]},"content_html":"<p>Gazpacho frío de tomate y hortalizas crudas, pan remojado, aceite de oliva y vinagre de vino tinto, sin cocción ni colado. Se proponen 4 raciones con guarnición tomada de las verduras medidas y 145 minutos completos, incluidos 120 de enfriado; cantidades, rendimiento y tiempos pendientes de ensayo.</p><p>Propuesta original de gazpacho frío de tomate, pepino con piel, pimiento verde, cebolla, ajo, pan, aceite y vinagre de vino tinto. Cantidades, cuatro porciones, textura y tiempos pendientes de prueba de cocina; no se afirma ensayo ni peso final. Conserva piel y semillas del tomate y toda el agua del pan; no cuela, por lo que no inventa pérdidas de nutrientes. La guarnición procede de las mismas hortalizas pesadas y no añade aceite ni pan extra. Usa tomates maduros en buen estado y pan ya horneado sin relleno; si tiene moho, descarta el pan, no recortes solo la zona. El tomate puede variar en acidez, agua y dulzor. Para cambiar la textura, anota cualquier agua extra y revisa rendimiento; para sustituir vinagre de vino tinto por Jerez, identifica la etiqueta y recalcula, sin suponer que son la misma ficha USDA. Omitir el pan o usar pan sin gluten cambia la fórmula y nutrición, sin prometer textura equivalente. Contiene trigo/gluten; revisa también leche, huevo o trazas según el pan y sulfitos según el vinagre. Lava produce bajo agua corriente sin jabón antes de cortar, limpia manos y utensilios, y evita contaminación cruzada con carnes o huevos crudos. Es una sopa de hortalizas crudas, no pasteurizada; el lavado reduce suciedad pero no elimina todos los microorganismos y el vinagre no es una garantía de seguridad. Refrigera enseguida a 4 °C o menos. Como propuesta doméstica de calidad no ensayada, consume el mismo día o dentro de 24 horas con cadena de frío continua; conserva sopa y guarnición por separado y usa utensilios limpios. No reutilices restos del plato ni prolongues conservación por olor agradable. Congelar puede separar la emulsión y alterar las hortalizas; no se establece aquí una conservación congelada verificada. Nutrición estimada con diez alimentos USDA exactos, toda la fórmula y guarnición divididas entre cuatro; marca del pan, aceite, vinagre y medición real cambian las cifras.</p>"},{"id":"1fdb5c51-5f3c-5e28-8dd3-3ec5ff3e027f","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"spanische-gazpacho","public_path":"/de/spanische-gazpacho","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot","excerpt":"Kalte Tomatengazpacho mit Gurke, Paprika und Brot: abgewogene Zutaten, eingerechnete Garnitur, vollständige Kühlzeit und USDA-gestützte Nährwertschätzung.","summary":"Kalte Gazpacho aus rohen Tomaten und Gemüse, eingeweichtem Brot, Olivenöl und Rotweinessig, ohne Kochen oder Passieren. Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen mit Garnitur aus den abgewogenen Zutaten und insgesamt 145 Minuten, einschließlich 120 Minuten Kühlung; Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht erprobt.","category":"Suppen und Cremesuppen","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Einfach","course":"Kalte Suppe","cuisine":"Spanisch","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"reife rote Tomaten, roh, ohne Stielansatz gewogen","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"rohe Gurke mit Schale, gewaschen und ohne Enden","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"grüne Gemüsepaprika ohne Stiel und Kerne","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"geschälte Zwiebel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"geschälter Knoblauch","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse"},{"name":"fertig gebackenes Weißbrot ohne Füllung oder Schimmel","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Basis und Würzung"},{"name":"Olivenöl","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Basis und Würzung"},{"name":"Rotweinessig","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Basis und Würzung"},{"name":"kaltes Trinkwasser","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Basis und Würzung"},{"name":"feines Salz","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Basis und Würzung"}],"steps":[{"title":"Gemüse waschen, prüfen und wiegen","content":"Hände waschen und sauberes Brett, Messer, Schüssel, Waage und Mixer vorbereiten, getrennt von Geräten für rohes Fleisch oder Ei. Tomaten, Gurke und Paprika unter fließendem Wasser ohne Seife waschen; die Gurke abreiben und vor dem Schneiden mit einem sauberen Tuch trocknen. Faules Gemüse entsorgen. Stielansätze und Enden entfernen; bei der Paprika Stiel und Kerne entfernen. Danach 800 g Tomaten, 150 g Gurke mit Schale, 100 g Paprika, 40 g geschälte Zwiebel und 4 g geschälten Knoblauch wiegen. Die Suppe wird roh gegessen; Waschen sterilisiert nicht.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Gemüse waschen, prüfen und wiegen"},{"title":"Brot einweichen und Garnitur zurücklegen","content":"Die 40 g fertig gebackenes Brot in einer Schüssel zerteilen und die 120 g kaltes Wasser darübergeben. 10 Minuten weich werden lassen und das gesamte Wasser behalten. Währenddessen 40 g Tomate, 20 g Gurke und 20 g Paprika klein würfeln und zugedeckt zum Servieren zurücklegen. Diese Garnitur bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Die übrigen 760 g Tomaten, 130 g Gurke und 80 g Paprika mit Zwiebel und Knoblauch für den Mixer zerkleinern. Einweichen und Schneiden laufen gleichzeitig und werden nicht nochmals zur Gesamtzeit addiert.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Brot einweichen und Garnitur zurücklegen"},{"title":"Basis pürieren, ohne zu passieren","content":"Die 760 g Tomaten, 130 g Gurke und 80 g Paprika für die Basis, 40 g Zwiebel, 4 g Knoblauch sowie sämtliches Brot mit Einweichwasser in den Mixer geben. Die 20 g Essig und 4 g Salz zugeben. Schließen und etwa 2 Minuten oder bis keine großen Stücke bleiben pürieren; maximale Füllmenge beachten und nötigenfalls portionsweise arbeiten. Vor dem Abschaben mit einem Teigschaber stoppen und Netzstecker ziehen. Tomatenschalen und -kerne nicht entfernen und anschließend nicht passieren; diese Rezeptur behält sie.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Basis pürieren, ohne zu passieren"},{"title":"Abgewogenes Öl einarbeiten","content":"Die 40 g Olivenöl zur pürierten Basis geben und etwa 1 Minute weiter mixen, bis die Mischung gleichmäßig und leicht cremig ist. Geräteanleitung beachten; erlaubt das Gerät keine Zugabe im Betrieb, stoppen, Öl zugeben, schließen und weiter pürieren. Kein Öl, Wasser, Eis oder Brot über die genannten Mengen hinaus zugeben. Konsistenz und Würzung bleiben für diesen Vorschlag abgewogen; spätere Änderungen dokumentieren und Nährwerte neu berechnen.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Abgewogenes Öl einarbeiten"},{"title":"Sofort kühlen, Garnitur getrennt halten","content":"Sämtliche Gazpacho in saubere, flache Behälter füllen, schließen und sofort bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Als Richtwert 120 Minuten kühlen, bis die gesamte Mischung kalt ist; nötigenfalls verlängern und die Mehrzeit addieren. Auch die Garnitur geschlossen und gekühlt halten. Essig ersetzt die Kühlung nicht und macht falsch gelagerte Suppe nicht sicher. Die Suppe zum Abkühlen nicht erst auf der Arbeitsfläche stehen lassen.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Sofort kühlen, Garnitur getrennt halten"},{"title":"Umrühren und ohne Zusätze aufteilen","content":"Gazpacho erst zum Servieren herausnehmen und mit einem sauberen Löffel umrühren, um getrennte Schichten wieder zu verbinden. Die gesamte Suppe gleichmäßig auf 4 Schüsseln verteilen. Die abgewogene Garnitur in 4 Teile mit jeweils 10 g Tomate, 5 g Gurke und 5 g Paprika teilen und daraufgeben. Kein zusätzliches Öl, Brot, Ei oder Kräuter zugeben; sie gehören nicht zu dieser Rezeptur. Nicht sofort gegessene Portionen gekühlt halten.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Umrühren und ohne Zusätze aufteilen"},{"title":"Kalt servieren und Reste lagern","content":"Je eine der 4 Portionen servieren. Der vollständige Vorschlag benötigt 145 Minuten: 25 Vorbereitung, einschließlich 10 Minuten Einweichen parallel zum Gemüseschneiden, sowie 120 Kühlung; es wird nicht gekocht. Die Zutaten ergeben 1418 g Rohgewicht, kein gemessenes Fertiggewicht; Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht erprobt. Als ungetesteter Haushaltsvorschlag zur Qualität möglichst am selben Tag oder innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen, stets geschlossen bei höchstens 4 °C, und Tellerreste niemals zum Vorrat zurückgeben.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Traditionelle spanische Gazpacho mit Gemüse und Brot: Kalt servieren und Reste lagern"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"reife rote Tomaten, roh, ohne Stielansatz gewogen","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"rohe Gurke mit Schale, gewaschen und ohne Enden","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"grüne Gemüsepaprika ohne Stiel und Kerne","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geschälte Zwiebel","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geschälter Knoblauch","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fertig gebackenes Weißbrot ohne Füllung oder Schimmel","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Olivenöl","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"Rotweinessig","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kaltes Trinkwasser","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"feines Salz","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Ein Viertel der abgewogenen Suppe und Garnitur; fertiges Gewicht nicht bestätigt","method":"Nährstoffe von 800 g Tomaten, 150 g Gurke mit Schale, 100 g grüner Paprika, 40 g Zwiebel, 4 g Knoblauch, 40 g Brot, 40 g Öl, 20 g Rotweinessig, 120 g Wasser und 4 g Salz summieren und durch 4 teilen. Garnitur stammt aus diesen Mengen, keine zusätzliche Rechnung. Kein Passieren oder erfundene Verluste.","note":"Rezepturschätzung, keine Laboranalyse oder Küchenmessung. Zehn exakte USDA-SR-Legacy-Fichen mit allen acht Nährstoffen; fehlende Werte nicht durch null ersetzt. Gurkenschale, sämtliches Brot, Tomatenschalen und -kerne und gesamte Würzung enthalten. Marken, Reste und Ausbeute verändern die Werte. 1418 g sind die Zutatensumme, kein gemessenes Fertiggewicht."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Rötlich orange kalte Gazpacho in einer weißen Schüssel mit kleinen Tomaten-, Gurken- und grünen Paprikawürfeln"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["spanische Gazpacho","traditionelle Gazpacho","kalte Tomatensuppe","Gazpacho mit Brot"],"notes":"Originaler Vorschlag für kalte Gazpacho aus Tomaten, Gurke mit Schale, grüner Paprika, Zwiebel, Knoblauch, Brot, Öl und Rotweinessig. Mengen, vier Portionen, Konsistenz und Zeiten sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt; kein fertiges Gewicht wird behauptet. Tomatenschalen und -kerne sowie sämtliches Einweichwasser bleiben erhalten; ohne Passieren werden keine Nährstoffverluste erfunden. Die Garnitur stammt aus dem abgewogenen Gemüse, ohne zusätzliches Öl oder Brot. Einwandfreie reife Tomaten und fertig gebackenes Brot ohne Füllung verwenden; schimmliges Brot ganz entsorgen, nicht nur die sichtbare Stelle abschneiden. Tomaten variieren in Säure, Wasser und Süße. Zusätzliches Wasser dokumentieren und Ausbeute prüfen; bei Sherry- statt Rotweinessig Etikett prüfen und neu rechnen, nicht dieselbe USDA-Fiche annehmen. Brot weglassen oder glutenfreies Brot verändert Rezeptur und Nährwerte ohne Garantie derselben Konsistenz. Enthält Weizen/Gluten; je nach Brot auch Milch, Ei oder Spuren und je nach Essig Sulfite prüfen. Gemüse vor dem Schneiden ohne Seife unter fließendem Wasser waschen, Hände und Geräte reinigen und Kontakt mit rohem Fleisch oder Ei vermeiden. Rohe, nicht pasteurisierte Gemüsesuppe: Waschen beseitigt nicht alle Mikroorganismen und Essig garantiert keine Sicherheit. Sofort bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Ungetesteter Haushaltsqualitätsvorschlag: am selben Tag oder innerhalb von 24 Stunden bei ununterbrochener Kühlung essen; Suppe und Garnitur getrennt, mit sauberen Geräten lagern. Keine Tellerreste zurückgeben oder Lagerung wegen angenehmen Geruchs verlängern. Einfrieren kann Emulsion und Gemüse verändern; keine geprüfte Tiefkühllagerung wird festgelegt. Nährwerte sind aus zehn exakten USDA-Lebensmitteln einschließlich Garnitur, geteilt durch vier, geschätzt; Marken und tatsächliche Messung ändern sie.","seo":{"title":"Spanische Gazpacho: vollständige Zubereitung","description":"Kalte Gazpacho mit Tomaten, Gurke, Paprika und Brot. Eingerechnete Garnitur, vollständige Kühlzeit und geschätzte Nährwerte; Rezeptur noch nicht erprobt.","image_alt":"Rötlich orange kalte Gazpacho in einer weißen Schüssel mit kleinen Tomaten-, Gurken- und grünen Paprikawürfeln","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Muss ich passieren oder alles schälen?","a":"Diese Rezeptur behält Tomatenschalen und -kerne sowie die gewaschene Gurkenschale. Gründlich pürieren und nicht passieren; die Schätzung zählt alle abgewogenen essbaren Zutaten. Das Entfernen von Feststoffen verändert Ausbeute und Nährwerte und muss dokumentiert werden, ohne einen konkreten Verlust anzunehmen."},{"q":"Werden Garnitur und Öl zusätzlich gerechnet?","a":"Nein. 40 g Tomate, 20 g Gurke und 20 g Paprika aus den Gesamtmengen zurücklegen und auf 4 Portionen verteilen. Die 40 g Öl kommen in die Suppe, ohne zusätzlichen Schuss. Brot mit den 120 g Wasser einweichen und das Wasser behalten."},{"q":"Wie lange dauert es, und wie lange hält es kalt?","a":"Vorgeschlagen sind 145 Minuten, 25 Vorbereitung und 120 Kühlung; verlängern, wenn die Suppe noch nicht kalt ist. Kein Kochen oder bestätigter Küchenversuch. Sofort bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen und als unbestätigten Haushaltsqualitätsvorschlag am selben Tag oder innerhalb von 24 Stunden essen. Essig ersetzt die Kühlkette nicht."}]},"content_html":"<p>Kalte Gazpacho aus rohen Tomaten und Gemüse, eingeweichtem Brot, Olivenöl und Rotweinessig, ohne Kochen oder Passieren. Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen mit Garnitur aus den abgewogenen Zutaten und insgesamt 145 Minuten, einschließlich 120 Minuten Kühlung; Mengen, Ausbeute und Zeiten sind noch nicht erprobt.</p><p>Originaler Vorschlag für kalte Gazpacho aus Tomaten, Gurke mit Schale, grüner Paprika, Zwiebel, Knoblauch, Brot, Öl und Rotweinessig. Mengen, vier Portionen, Konsistenz und Zeiten sind noch nicht in der Küche erprobt; kein fertiges Gewicht wird behauptet. Tomatenschalen und -kerne sowie sämtliches Einweichwasser bleiben erhalten; ohne Passieren werden keine Nährstoffverluste erfunden. Die Garnitur stammt aus dem abgewogenen Gemüse, ohne zusätzliches Öl oder Brot. Einwandfreie reife Tomaten und fertig gebackenes Brot ohne Füllung verwenden; schimmliges Brot ganz entsorgen, nicht nur die sichtbare Stelle abschneiden. Tomaten variieren in Säure, Wasser und Süße. Zusätzliches Wasser dokumentieren und Ausbeute prüfen; bei Sherry- statt Rotweinessig Etikett prüfen und neu rechnen, nicht dieselbe USDA-Fiche annehmen. Brot weglassen oder glutenfreies Brot verändert Rezeptur und Nährwerte ohne Garantie derselben Konsistenz. Enthält Weizen/Gluten; je nach Brot auch Milch, Ei oder Spuren und je nach Essig Sulfite prüfen. Gemüse vor dem Schneiden ohne Seife unter fließendem Wasser waschen, Hände und Geräte reinigen und Kontakt mit rohem Fleisch oder Ei vermeiden. Rohe, nicht pasteurisierte Gemüsesuppe: Waschen beseitigt nicht alle Mikroorganismen und Essig garantiert keine Sicherheit. Sofort bei höchstens 4 °C kühlen. Ungetesteter Haushaltsqualitätsvorschlag: am selben Tag oder innerhalb von 24 Stunden bei ununterbrochener Kühlung essen; Suppe und Garnitur getrennt, mit sauberen Geräten lagern. Keine Tellerreste zurückgeben oder Lagerung wegen angenehmen Geruchs verlängern. Einfrieren kann Emulsion und Gemüse verändern; keine geprüfte Tiefkühllagerung wird festgelegt. Nährwerte sind aus zehn exakten USDA-Lebensmitteln einschließlich Garnitur, geteilt durch vier, geschätzt; Marken und tatsächliche Messung ändern sie.</p>"},{"id":"ab1d803e-4b7d-588f-aa69-34dc76a2f00b","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"traditional-spanish-gazpacho","public_path":"/en/traditional-spanish-gazpacho","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/en/traditional-spanish-gazpacho/","language":"en","title":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread","excerpt":"Cold tomato gazpacho with cucumber, green pepper and bread: grouped quantities, garnish included, full chilling time and USDA-based estimated nutrition.","summary":"Cold gazpacho made from raw tomatoes and vegetables, soaked bread, olive oil and red wine vinegar, without cooking or straining. The proposal makes 4 portions with garnish taken from the measured vegetables and takes 145 minutes including 120 chilling; quantities, yield and times await kitchen trials.","category":"Soups & creams","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Easy","course":"Cold soup","cuisine":"Spanish","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"ripe red tomatoes, raw, weighed without stems","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"raw cucumber with skin, washed and trimmed","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"sweet green pepper, stem and seeds removed","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"peeled onion","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"peeled garlic","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables"},{"name":"ready-baked plain white bread, without filling or mold","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base and seasoning"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base and seasoning"},{"name":"red wine vinegar","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Base and seasoning"},{"name":"cold drinking water","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Base and seasoning"},{"name":"fine salt","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Base and seasoning"}],"steps":[{"title":"Wash, check and weigh the vegetables","content":"Wash hands and prepare clean board, knife, bowl, scales and blender, separate from tools used for raw meat or egg. Wash tomatoes, cucumber and pepper under running water without soap; scrub the cucumber and dry with a clean cloth before cutting. Discard rotten produce. Remove stems and ends, and remove pepper stem and seeds. Then weigh 800 g tomatoes, 150 g cucumber with skin, 100 g pepper, 40 g peeled onion and 4 g peeled garlic. This recipe is eaten raw; washing does not sterilize.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Wash, check and weigh the vegetables"},{"title":"Soak the bread and reserve the garnish","content":"Tear the 40 g ready-baked bread into a bowl and pour over the 120 g cold water. Soften for 10 minutes, keeping all the water. Meanwhile, finely dice and reserve 40 g tomato, 20 g cucumber and 20 g pepper in a covered container for serving. Refrigerate this garnish at 4 °C or below. Chop the remaining 760 g tomato, 130 g cucumber and 80 g pepper for the blender, along with onion and garlic. Soaking overlaps chopping and is not added again to the total.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Soak the bread and reserve the garnish"},{"title":"Blend the base without straining","content":"Put the base's 760 g tomato, 130 g cucumber and 80 g pepper, the 40 g onion, 4 g garlic and all the bread with its soaking water into the blender. Add the 20 g vinegar and 4 g salt. Close the lid and blend for about 2 minutes or until no large pieces remain; respect the appliance's maximum capacity and work in batches if needed. Stop and unplug before scraping down with a spatula. Do not remove tomato skins or seeds or strain afterwards; this formula retains them.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Blend the base without straining"},{"title":"Emulsify with the measured oil","content":"Add the 40 g olive oil to the blended base and blend for about 1 minute more until uniform and slightly creamy. Follow the appliance instructions; if adding oil while running is not allowed, stop, add, close and blend again. Add no oil, water, ice or bread beyond the quantities. This proposal keeps the measured texture and seasoning; later changes must be recorded and nutrition recalculated.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Emulsify with the measured oil"},{"title":"Chill immediately, keeping garnish separate","content":"Transfer all the gazpacho to clean shallow containers, cover and immediately refrigerate at 4 °C or below. Allow 120 minutes as a reference until the entire mixture is cold; extend if needed and add that time to the total. Keep the garnish covered and refrigerated too. Vinegar does not replace refrigeration or make badly stored soup safe. Do not leave the soup on the counter first to cool.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Chill immediately, keeping garnish separate"},{"title":"Stir and portion without extra ingredients","content":"Take the gazpacho out only for serving and stir with a clean spoon to recombine any separated layers. Divide all the soup equally among 4 bowls. Divide the measured garnish into 4 portions, each with 10 g tomato, 5 g cucumber and 5 g pepper, and place on top. Add no extra oil drizzle, bread, egg or herbs; they are outside this formula. Keep portions not eaten immediately refrigerated.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Stir and portion without extra ingredients"},{"title":"Serve cold and store the remainder","content":"Serve one of the 4 portions per person. The complete proposal takes 145 minutes: 25 preparation, including the 10-minute bread soak while vegetables are chopped, plus 120 chilling; there is no cooking. Ingredients total 1418 g raw, not a measured finished weight; yield and times await kitchen trials. As an untested household quality proposal, preferably eat the same day or within 24 hours, always covered at 4 °C or below, without returning plate leftovers to the storage container.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho with vegetables and bread: Serve cold and store the remainder"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"ripe red tomatoes, raw, weighed without stems","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"raw cucumber with skin, washed and trimmed","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sweet green pepper, stem and seeds removed","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peeled onion","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peeled garlic","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ready-baked plain white bread, without filling or mold","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"olive oil","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"red wine vinegar","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cold drinking water","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fine salt","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"One quarter of the measured soup and garnish; finished weight unconfirmed","method":"Sum nutrients from 800 g tomato, 150 g skin-on cucumber, 100 g green pepper, 40 g onion, 4 g garlic, 40 g bread, 40 g oil, 20 g red wine vinegar, 120 g water and 4 g salt; divide by 4. Garnish comes from these amounts and is not counted twice. No straining or invented losses.","note":"Formulation estimate, not a laboratory analysis or kitchen result. Ten exact USDA SR Legacy foods with all eight nutrients present, no missing values replaced with zero. Includes cucumber skin, all bread, tomato skins and seeds and all seasoning; brands, leftovers and yield change the values. The 1418 g is an ingredient sum, not a measured finished weight."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Reddish orange cold gazpacho in a white bowl topped with small tomato, skin-on cucumber and green pepper dice"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["traditional gazpacho","Spanish gazpacho","cold tomato soup","gazpacho with bread"],"notes":"Original proposal for cold gazpacho with tomato, skin-on cucumber, green pepper, onion, garlic, bread, oil and red wine vinegar. Quantities, four portions, texture and times await kitchen trials; no testing or finished weight is claimed. Tomato skins and seeds and all bread-soaking water are retained; no straining or invented nutrient loss. Garnish comes from the measured vegetables with no extra oil or bread. Choose sound ripe tomatoes and ready-baked unfilled bread; discard moldy bread rather than trimming only the visible patch. Tomato acidity, water and sweetness vary. Record added water and review yield when changing texture; substituting sherry vinegar requires its label and recalculation rather than assuming the same USDA food. Omitting bread or using gluten-free bread changes formula and nutrition, with no promise of equivalent texture. Contains wheat/gluten; check bread for milk, egg or traces and vinegar for sulfites. Wash produce under running water without soap before cutting, clean hands and utensils and avoid raw meat or egg cross-contamination. This is raw, unpasteurized vegetable soup; washing does not remove every microorganism and vinegar is no safety guarantee. Refrigerate immediately at 4 °C or below. As an untested household quality proposal, consume the same day or within 24 hours with an uninterrupted cold chain; store soup and garnish separately and use clean tools. Never return plate leftovers or extend storage because it smells pleasant. Freezing may separate the emulsion and affect vegetables; no verified frozen shelf life is established here. Nutrition estimates use ten exact USDA foods and the complete formula and garnish divided by four; bread, oil and vinegar brands and actual measurement change the figures.","seo":{"title":"Traditional Spanish gazpacho: complete recipe","description":"Cold gazpacho with tomato, cucumber, green pepper and bread. Measured garnish, full chilling time and estimated nutrition; proposed quantities without a kitchen trial.","image_alt":"Reddish orange cold gazpacho in a white bowl topped with small tomato, skin-on cucumber and green pepper dice","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Do I need to strain it or peel all the vegetables?","a":"This formula keeps tomato skins and seeds and washed cucumber skin. Blend thoroughly without straining, so the estimate counts all weighed edible ingredients. Removing solids changes yield and nutrition and must be recorded without assuming a specific loss."},{"q":"Are garnish and oil counted separately?","a":"No. Reserve 40 g tomato, 20 g cucumber and 20 g pepper from the total quantities and divide among 4 portions. The 40 g oil goes into the soup, with no extra drizzle. Bread soaks in the 120 g water, which is also retained."},{"q":"How long does it take, and how long can it be chilled?","a":"The proposal takes 145 minutes, 25 preparation and 120 chilling; extend if still not cold. There is no cooking or confirmed kitchen trial. Refrigerate immediately at 4 °C or below and, as an unverified household quality proposal, eat the same day or within 24 hours. Vinegar does not replace the cold chain."}]},"content_html":"<p>Cold gazpacho made from raw tomatoes and vegetables, soaked bread, olive oil and red wine vinegar, without cooking or straining. The proposal makes 4 portions with garnish taken from the measured vegetables and takes 145 minutes including 120 chilling; quantities, yield and times await kitchen trials.</p><p>Original proposal for cold gazpacho with tomato, skin-on cucumber, green pepper, onion, garlic, bread, oil and red wine vinegar. Quantities, four portions, texture and times await kitchen trials; no testing or finished weight is claimed. Tomato skins and seeds and all bread-soaking water are retained; no straining or invented nutrient loss. Garnish comes from the measured vegetables with no extra oil or bread. Choose sound ripe tomatoes and ready-baked unfilled bread; discard moldy bread rather than trimming only the visible patch. Tomato acidity, water and sweetness vary. Record added water and review yield when changing texture; substituting sherry vinegar requires its label and recalculation rather than assuming the same USDA food. Omitting bread or using gluten-free bread changes formula and nutrition, with no promise of equivalent texture. Contains wheat/gluten; check bread for milk, egg or traces and vinegar for sulfites. Wash produce under running water without soap before cutting, clean hands and utensils and avoid raw meat or egg cross-contamination. This is raw, unpasteurized vegetable soup; washing does not remove every microorganism and vinegar is no safety guarantee. Refrigerate immediately at 4 °C or below. As an untested household quality proposal, consume the same day or within 24 hours with an uninterrupted cold chain; store soup and garnish separately and use clean tools. Never return plate leftovers or extend storage because it smells pleasant. Freezing may separate the emulsion and affect vegetables; no verified frozen shelf life is established here. Nutrition estimates use ten exact USDA foods and the complete formula and garnish divided by four; bread, oil and vinegar brands and actual measurement change the figures.</p>"},{"id":"3d481d92-df16-59ec-b384-2cb4ea465b96","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","public_path":"/fr/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/","language":"fr","title":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain","excerpt":"Gazpacho froid de tomate, concombre, poivron et pain : quantités regroupées, garniture incluse, refroidissement complet et nutrition estimée avec fiches USDA.","summary":"Gazpacho froid de tomates et légumes crus, pain trempé, huile d’olive et vinaigre de vin rouge, sans cuisson ni filtrage. La proposition donne 4 portions avec garniture prélevée sur les légumes pesés et 145 minutes au total, dont 120 de refroidissement ; quantités, rendement et durées restent à tester.","category":"Soupes et crèmes","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Soupe froide","cuisine":"Espagnole","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"tomates rouges mûres crues, pesées sans pédoncule","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"concombre cru avec peau, lavé et paré","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"poivron vert doux sans tige ni graines","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"oignon pelé","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"ail pelé","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Légumes"},{"name":"pain blanc déjà cuit, sans garniture ni moisissure","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base et assaisonnement"},{"name":"huile d’olive","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base et assaisonnement"},{"name":"vinaigre de vin rouge","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Base et assaisonnement"},{"name":"eau potable froide","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Base et assaisonnement"},{"name":"sel fin","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Base et assaisonnement"}],"steps":[{"title":"Laver, vérifier et peser les légumes","content":"Se laver les mains et préparer planche, couteau, saladier, balance et mixeur propres, séparés des ustensiles pour viande ou œuf crus. Laver tomates, concombre et poivron sous l’eau courante sans savon ; frotter le concombre et sécher avec un linge propre avant de couper. Jeter les légumes pourris. Retirer pédoncules et extrémités ; enlever tige et graines du poivron. Peser ensuite 800 g de tomates, 150 g de concombre avec peau, 100 g de poivron, 40 g d’oignon pelé et 4 g d’ail pelé. La recette se mange crue ; laver ne stérilise pas.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Laver, vérifier et peser les légumes"},{"title":"Tremper le pain et réserver la garniture","content":"Déchirer les 40 g de pain déjà cuit dans un saladier et verser les 120 g d’eau froide. Laisser ramollir 10 minutes et conserver toute l’eau. Pendant ce temps, réserver 40 g de tomate, 20 g de concombre et 20 g de poivron en petits dés dans un récipient couvert pour servir. Réfrigérer cette garniture à 4 °C maximum. Couper pour le mixeur les 760 g de tomate, 130 g de concombre et 80 g de poivron restants, avec l’oignon et l’ail. Trempage et découpe se font en parallèle, sans ajouter à nouveau cette durée au total.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Tremper le pain et réserver la garniture"},{"title":"Mixer la base sans filtrer","content":"Mettre dans le bol les 760 g de tomate, 130 g de concombre et 80 g de poivron de la base, les 40 g d’oignon, les 4 g d’ail et tout le pain avec son eau. Ajouter les 20 g de vinaigre et les 4 g de sel. Fermer et mixer environ 2 minutes, ou jusqu’à disparition des gros morceaux ; respecter la capacité maximale et procéder en plusieurs fois si nécessaire. Arrêter et débrancher avant de racler avec une spatule. Ne pas retirer peaux ou graines des tomates ni filtrer ensuite : cette formule les conserve.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Mixer la base sans filtrer"},{"title":"Émulsionner avec l’huile pesée","content":"Ajouter les 40 g d’huile d’olive à la base mixée et mixer environ 1 minute de plus pour obtenir une texture uniforme et légèrement crémeuse. Suivre la notice ; si l’appareil ne permet pas l’ajout en marche, arrêter, ajouter, fermer et mixer à nouveau. Ne pas ajouter d’huile, d’eau, de glace ou de pain en dehors des quantités. La texture et l’assaisonnement restent mesurés pour cette proposition ; noter les modifications ultérieures et recalculer la nutrition.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Émulsionner avec l’huile pesée"},{"title":"Refroidir aussitôt, garniture séparée","content":"Transférer tout le gazpacho dans des récipients propres peu profonds, couvrir et réfrigérer immédiatement à 4 °C maximum. Prévoir 120 minutes indicatives jusqu’à ce que toute la préparation soit froide ; prolonger si nécessaire et ajouter cette durée au total. Garder la garniture également couverte et réfrigérée. Le vinaigre ne remplace pas le froid et ne rend pas sûre une soupe mal conservée. Ne pas laisser d’abord la soupe refroidir sur le plan de travail.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Refroidir aussitôt, garniture séparée"},{"title":"Remuer et répartir sans ajout","content":"Sortir le gazpacho seulement pour servir et remuer avec une cuillère propre pour réunir les couches éventuellement séparées. Répartir toute la soupe dans 4 bols égaux. Diviser la garniture pesée en 4 parts avec chacune 10 g de tomate, 5 g de concombre et 5 g de poivron, puis déposer dessus. Ne pas ajouter d’huile, de pain, d’œuf ni d’herbes : ils ne font pas partie de cette formule. Garder au froid les portions non consommées immédiatement.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Remuer et répartir sans ajout"},{"title":"Servir froid et conserver le reste","content":"Servir une des 4 portions par personne. La proposition complète demande 145 minutes : 25 de préparation, dont 10 de trempage pendant la découpe, et 120 de refroidissement ; aucune cuisson. Les ingrédients totalisent 1418 g crus, pas un poids final mesuré ; rendement et durées attendent un essai culinaire. Comme proposition domestique de qualité non testée, consommer de préférence le jour même ou sous 24 heures, toujours couvert à 4 °C maximum, sans remettre les restes du bol dans le récipient.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel aux légumes et au pain: Servir froid et conserver le reste"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"tomates rouges mûres crues, pesées sans pédoncule","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"concombre cru avec peau, lavé et paré","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"poivron vert doux sans tige ni graines","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"oignon pelé","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ail pelé","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pain blanc déjà cuit, sans garniture ni moisissure","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"huile d’olive","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinaigre de vin rouge","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"eau potable froide","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sel fin","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un quart de la soupe et de la garniture pesées ; poids final non confirmé","method":"Additionner les nutriments de 800 g de tomate, 150 g de concombre avec peau, 100 g de poivron vert, 40 g d’oignon, 4 g d’ail, 40 g de pain, 40 g d’huile, 20 g de vinaigre de vin rouge, 120 g d’eau et 4 g de sel ; diviser par 4. La garniture vient de ces quantités, sans ajout séparé. Aucun filtrage ni perte inventée.","note":"Estimation de formulation, pas analyse de laboratoire ni résultat culinaire. Dix fiches USDA SR Legacy exactes avec les huit nutriments présents, sans remplir les absences par zéro. Peau du concombre, tout le pain, peaux et graines de tomate et tout l’assaisonnement inclus ; marques, restes et rendement changent les valeurs. Les 1418 g sont la somme des ingrédients, pas un poids final mesuré."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Gazpacho froid orange rouge dans un bol blanc, garni de petits dés de tomate, concombre avec peau et poivron vert"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["gazpacho traditionnel","gazpacho espagnol","soupe froide de tomate","gazpacho avec pain"],"notes":"Proposition originale de gazpacho froid de tomate, concombre avec peau, poivron vert, oignon, ail, pain, huile et vinaigre de vin rouge. Quantités, quatre portions, texture et durées restent à tester ; aucun essai ni poids final n’est affirmé. Peaux et graines des tomates et toute l’eau du pain sont conservées, sans filtrage ni perte nutritive inventée. La garniture provient des légumes pesés, sans huile ni pain supplémentaires. Choisir des tomates mûres en bon état et du pain déjà cuit sans garniture ; jeter tout pain moisi, sans se limiter à couper la partie visible. Acidité, eau et douceur des tomates varient. Noter toute eau ajoutée et revoir le rendement ; remplacer le vinaigre rouge par du Xérès demande de vérifier l’étiquette et recalculer, sans supposer la même fiche USDA. Sans pain ou avec pain sans gluten, formule et nutrition changent sans garantie de texture équivalente. Contient blé/gluten ; vérifier lait, œuf ou traces selon le pain et sulfites selon le vinaigre. Laver sous l’eau courante sans savon avant de couper, nettoyer mains et ustensiles, éviter contamination par viande ou œuf crus. Soupe de légumes crus non pasteurisée : le lavage ne retire pas tous les microbes et le vinaigre ne garantit pas la sécurité. Réfrigérer aussitôt à 4 °C maximum. Proposition domestique de qualité non testée : manger le jour même ou sous 24 heures avec chaîne du froid continue, soupe et garniture séparées et ustensiles propres. Ne pas remettre les restes du bol ni prolonger grâce à une bonne odeur. La congélation peut séparer l’émulsion et altérer les légumes ; aucune durée de conservation congelée vérifiée n’est fixée. Nutrition estimée avec dix aliments USDA exacts, toute la formule et garniture divisées par quatre ; marques et mesures réelles changent les chiffres.","seo":{"title":"Gazpacho espagnol traditionnel : recette complète","description":"Gazpacho froid de tomate, concombre, poivron et pain. Garniture pesée, refroidissement complet et nutrition estimée ; quantités proposées sans essai culinaire.","image_alt":"Gazpacho froid orange rouge dans un bol blanc, garni de petits dés de tomate, concombre avec peau et poivron vert","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Faut-il filtrer ou éplucher tous les légumes ?","a":"Cette formule conserve peaux et graines des tomates et peau lavée du concombre. Mixer soigneusement sans filtrer ; l’estimation compte toute la partie comestible pesée. Retirer des solides change rendement et nutrition et doit être noté, sans supposer une perte précise."},{"q":"La garniture et l’huile sont-elles ajoutées à part ?","a":"Non. Réserver 40 g de tomate, 20 g de concombre et 20 g de poivron sur les quantités totales et répartir entre 4 portions. Les 40 g d’huile vont dans la soupe, sans filet supplémentaire. Le pain trempe dans les 120 g d’eau, conservés également."},{"q":"Quelle durée et quelle conservation au froid ?","a":"La proposition demande 145 minutes, 25 de préparation et 120 de refroidissement ; prolonger si ce n’est pas froid. Aucune cuisson ni essai confirmé. Réfrigérer aussitôt à 4 °C maximum et, comme proposition domestique de qualité non vérifiée, consommer le jour même ou sous 24 heures. Le vinaigre ne remplace pas la chaîne du froid."}]},"content_html":"<p>Gazpacho froid de tomates et légumes crus, pain trempé, huile d’olive et vinaigre de vin rouge, sans cuisson ni filtrage. La proposition donne 4 portions avec garniture prélevée sur les légumes pesés et 145 minutes au total, dont 120 de refroidissement ; quantités, rendement et durées restent à tester.</p><p>Proposition originale de gazpacho froid de tomate, concombre avec peau, poivron vert, oignon, ail, pain, huile et vinaigre de vin rouge. Quantités, quatre portions, texture et durées restent à tester ; aucun essai ni poids final n’est affirmé. Peaux et graines des tomates et toute l’eau du pain sont conservées, sans filtrage ni perte nutritive inventée. La garniture provient des légumes pesés, sans huile ni pain supplémentaires. Choisir des tomates mûres en bon état et du pain déjà cuit sans garniture ; jeter tout pain moisi, sans se limiter à couper la partie visible. Acidité, eau et douceur des tomates varient. Noter toute eau ajoutée et revoir le rendement ; remplacer le vinaigre rouge par du Xérès demande de vérifier l’étiquette et recalculer, sans supposer la même fiche USDA. Sans pain ou avec pain sans gluten, formule et nutrition changent sans garantie de texture équivalente. Contient blé/gluten ; vérifier lait, œuf ou traces selon le pain et sulfites selon le vinaigre. Laver sous l’eau courante sans savon avant de couper, nettoyer mains et ustensiles, éviter contamination par viande ou œuf crus. Soupe de légumes crus non pasteurisée : le lavage ne retire pas tous les microbes et le vinaigre ne garantit pas la sécurité. Réfrigérer aussitôt à 4 °C maximum. Proposition domestique de qualité non testée : manger le jour même ou sous 24 heures avec chaîne du froid continue, soupe et garniture séparées et ustensiles propres. Ne pas remettre les restes du bol ni prolonger grâce à une bonne odeur. La congélation peut séparer l’émulsion et altérer les légumes ; aucune durée de conservation congelée vérifiée n’est fixée. Nutrition estimée avec dix aliments USDA exacts, toute la formule et garniture divisées par quatre ; marques et mesures réelles changent les chiffres.</p>"},{"id":"614403db-090d-5c05-af01-31625913eaf3","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"gazpacho-tradizionale-spagnolo","public_path":"/it/gazpacho-tradizionale-spagnolo","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/gazpacho-tradizionale-spagnolo/","language":"it","title":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane","excerpt":"Gazpacho freddo di pomodoro con cetriolo, peperone e pane: quantità raggruppate, guarnizione inclusa, raffreddamento completo e nutrizione stimata da schede USDA.","summary":"Gazpacho freddo di pomodoro e verdure crude, pane ammollato, olio d’oliva e aceto di vino rosso, senza cottura né filtraggio. Si propongono 4 porzioni con guarnizione ricavata dalle verdure pesate e 145 minuti totali, inclusi 120 di raffreddamento; quantità, resa e tempi attendono prove in cucina.","category":"Zuppe e creme","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Facile","course":"Zuppa fredda","cuisine":"Spagnola","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"pomodori rossi maturi crudi, pesati senza picciolo","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"cetriolo crudo con buccia, lavato e spuntato","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"peperone verde dolce senza picciolo né semi","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"cipolla sbucciata","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"aglio sbucciato","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Verdure"},{"name":"pane bianco già cotto, senza ripieno né muffa","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base e condimento"},{"name":"olio d’oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base e condimento"},{"name":"aceto di vino rosso","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Base e condimento"},{"name":"acqua potabile fredda","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Base e condimento"},{"name":"sale fino","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Base e condimento"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lava, controlla e pesa le verdure","content":"Lava le mani e prepara tagliere, coltello, ciotola, bilancia e frullatore puliti, separati dagli utensili usati per carne o uovo crudi. Lava pomodori, cetriolo e peperone sotto acqua corrente senza sapone; strofina il cetriolo e asciuga con un panno pulito prima di tagliare. Scarta le verdure marce. Elimina piccioli ed estremità; togli picciolo e semi al peperone. Pesa poi 800 g di pomodori, 150 g di cetriolo con buccia, 100 g di peperone, 40 g di cipolla sbucciata e 4 g di aglio sbucciato. La ricetta si consuma cruda: lavare non sterilizza.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Lava, controlla e pesa le verdure"},{"title":"Ammolla il pane e riserva la guarnizione","content":"Spezzetta i 40 g di pane già cotto in una ciotola e versa i 120 g di acqua fredda. Lascia ammorbidire 10 minuti, conservando tutta l’acqua. Nel frattempo taglia a dadini e riserva 40 g di pomodoro, 20 g di cetriolo e 20 g di peperone in un contenitore coperto per servire. Refrigera questa guarnizione a 4 °C o meno. Taglia per il frullatore i restanti 760 g di pomodoro, 130 g di cetriolo e 80 g di peperone insieme a cipolla e aglio. Ammollo e taglio si sovrappongono e non si sommano di nuovo al totale.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Ammolla il pane e riserva la guarnizione"},{"title":"Frulla la base senza filtrare","content":"Metti nel bicchiere i 760 g di pomodoro, 130 g di cetriolo e 80 g di peperone della base, i 40 g di cipolla, i 4 g di aglio e tutto il pane con la sua acqua. Aggiungi i 20 g di aceto e i 4 g di sale. Chiudi e frulla circa 2 minuti, o fino a eliminare i pezzi grandi; rispetta la capacità massima e lavora in più riprese se necessario. Ferma e scollega prima di raschiare con una spatola. Non togliere bucce o semi del pomodoro e non filtrare dopo: questa formula li conserva.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Frulla la base senza filtrare"},{"title":"Emulsiona con l’olio pesato","content":"Aggiungi i 40 g di olio d’oliva alla base frullata e lavora circa 1 minuto ancora, fino a ottenere una miscela uniforme e leggermente cremosa. Segui le istruzioni dell’apparecchio; se non consente aggiunte in funzione, ferma, aggiungi, chiudi e frulla di nuovo. Non aggiungere olio, acqua, ghiaccio o pane oltre le quantità. Questa proposta mantiene consistenza e condimento misurati; annota cambiamenti successivi e ricalcola la nutrizione.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Emulsiona con l’olio pesato"},{"title":"Raffredda subito con guarnizione separata","content":"Trasferisci tutto il gazpacho in contenitori puliti poco profondi, copri e refrigera subito a 4 °C o meno. Raffredda per 120 minuti indicativi, finché tutta la miscela è fredda; prolunga se serve e aggiungi il tempo al totale. Mantieni anche la guarnizione coperta e refrigerata. L’aceto non sostituisce il freddo e non rende sicura una zuppa mal conservata. Non lasciarla prima sul piano per raffreddarla.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Raffredda subito con guarnizione separata"},{"title":"Mescola e dividi senza aggiunte","content":"Tira fuori il gazpacho solo per servire e mescola con un cucchiaio pulito per riunire eventuali strati separati. Dividi tutta la zuppa in 4 ciotole uguali. Ripartisci la guarnizione misurata in 4 porzioni, ciascuna con 10 g di pomodoro, 5 g di cetriolo e 5 g di peperone, e mettila sopra. Non aggiungere olio, pane, uovo o erbe extra: non fanno parte di questa formula. Tieni al freddo le porzioni non consumate subito.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Mescola e dividi senza aggiunte"},{"title":"Servi freddo e conserva il resto","content":"Servi una delle 4 porzioni a persona. La proposta completa richiede 145 minuti: 25 di preparazione, compreso l’ammollo di 10 mentre si tagliano le verdure, e 120 di raffreddamento; non c’è cottura. Gli ingredienti sommano 1418 g crudi, non un peso finale misurato; resa e tempi attendono prove in cucina. Come proposta domestica di qualità non testata, consuma preferibilmente in giornata o entro 24 ore, sempre coperto a 4 °C o meno, senza rimettere avanzi del piatto nel contenitore.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo con verdure e pane: Servi freddo e conserva il resto"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"pomodori rossi maturi crudi, pesati senza picciolo","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cetriolo crudo con buccia, lavato e spuntato","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peperone verde dolce senza picciolo né semi","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cipolla sbucciata","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aglio sbucciato","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pane bianco già cotto, senza ripieno né muffa","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"olio d’oliva","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceto di vino rosso","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"acqua potabile fredda","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sale fino","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un quarto di zuppa e guarnizione misurate; peso finale non confermato","method":"Somma i nutrienti di 800 g di pomodoro, 150 g di cetriolo con buccia, 100 g di peperone verde, 40 g di cipolla, 4 g di aglio, 40 g di pane, 40 g di olio, 20 g di aceto di vino rosso, 120 g di acqua e 4 g di sale; dividi per 4. La guarnizione proviene da queste quantità, senza conteggio aggiuntivo. Nessun filtraggio o perdita inventata.","note":"Stima di formulazione, non analisi di laboratorio né risultato di cucina. Dieci schede USDA SR Legacy esatte con otto nutrienti presenti, senza sostituire assenze con zero. Include buccia del cetriolo, tutto il pane, bucce e semi del pomodoro e tutto il condimento; marche, avanzi e resa modificano i valori. I 1418 g sono somma di ingredienti, non peso finale misurato."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Gazpacho freddo rosso aranciato in una ciotola bianca con dadini di pomodoro, cetriolo con buccia e peperone verde"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["gazpacho tradizionale","gazpacho spagnolo","zuppa fredda di pomodoro","gazpacho con pane"],"notes":"Proposta originale di gazpacho freddo con pomodoro, cetriolo con buccia, peperone verde, cipolla, aglio, pane, olio e aceto di vino rosso. Quantità, quattro porzioni, consistenza e tempi attendono prove in cucina, senza dichiarare test o peso finale. Mantiene bucce e semi del pomodoro e tutta l’acqua del pane; senza filtraggio non inventa perdite di nutrienti. La guarnizione viene dalle stesse verdure pesate, senza olio o pane extra. Usa pomodori maturi sani e pane già cotto senza ripieno; scarta tutto il pane ammuffito, non solo la zona visibile. Acidità, acqua e dolcezza dei pomodori variano. Annota acqua aggiunta e rivedi resa; per aceto di Jerez al posto di quello rosso verifica etichetta e ricalcola, senza assumere la stessa scheda USDA. Omettere il pane o usarlo senza glutine cambia formula e nutrizione, senza garantire consistenza equivalente. Contiene frumento/glutine; controlla anche latte, uovo o tracce del pane e solfiti dell’aceto. Lava verdure sotto acqua corrente senza sapone prima del taglio, pulisci mani e utensili ed evita contaminazione da carne o uovo crudi. Zuppa di verdure crude non pastorizzata: il lavaggio non elimina tutti i microrganismi e l’aceto non garantisce sicurezza. Refrigera subito a 4 °C o meno. Proposta domestica di qualità non testata: consuma in giornata o entro 24 ore con freddo continuo; conserva zuppa e guarnizione separate e usa utensili puliti. Non riutilizzare avanzi del piatto né prolungare conservazione perché ha buon odore. Il congelamento può separare l’emulsione e alterare le verdure; non si stabilisce durata congelata verificata. Nutrizione stimata con dieci alimenti USDA esatti, formula e guarnizione intere divise per quattro; marche e misurazioni reali cambiano i valori.","seo":{"title":"Gazpacho tradizionale spagnolo: ricetta completa","description":"Gazpacho freddo con pomodoro, cetriolo, peperone e pane. Guarnizione misurata, raffreddamento completo e nutrizione stimata; quantità proposte senza test.","image_alt":"Gazpacho freddo rosso aranciato in una ciotola bianca con dadini di pomodoro, cetriolo con buccia e peperone verde","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Devo filtrare o sbucciare tutte le verdure?","a":"Questa formula conserva bucce e semi del pomodoro e buccia lavata del cetriolo. Frulla bene senza filtrare: la stima conta tutta la parte commestibile pesata. Togliere solidi cambia resa e nutrizione e va annotato, senza ipotizzare una perdita precisa."},{"q":"Guarnizione e olio si sommano a parte?","a":"No. Riserva 40 g di pomodoro, 20 g di cetriolo e 20 g di peperone dai totali e dividi in 4 porzioni. I 40 g di olio vanno nella zuppa, senza filo aggiuntivo. Il pane si ammolla con i 120 g di acqua, anch’essi conservati."},{"q":"Quanto tempo serve e quanto dura in frigorifero?","a":"Si propongono 145 minuti, 25 di preparazione e 120 di raffreddamento; prolunga se non è ancora freddo. Nessuna cottura né prova confermata. Refrigera subito a 4 °C o meno e, come proposta domestica di qualità non verificata, consuma in giornata o entro 24 ore. L’aceto non sostituisce la catena del freddo."}]},"content_html":"<p>Gazpacho freddo di pomodoro e verdure crude, pane ammollato, olio d’oliva e aceto di vino rosso, senza cottura né filtraggio. Si propongono 4 porzioni con guarnizione ricavata dalle verdure pesate e 145 minuti totali, inclusi 120 di raffreddamento; quantità, resa e tempi attendono prove in cucina.</p><p>Proposta originale di gazpacho freddo con pomodoro, cetriolo con buccia, peperone verde, cipolla, aglio, pane, olio e aceto di vino rosso. Quantità, quattro porzioni, consistenza e tempi attendono prove in cucina, senza dichiarare test o peso finale. Mantiene bucce e semi del pomodoro e tutta l’acqua del pane; senza filtraggio non inventa perdite di nutrienti. La guarnizione viene dalle stesse verdure pesate, senza olio o pane extra. Usa pomodori maturi sani e pane già cotto senza ripieno; scarta tutto il pane ammuffito, non solo la zona visibile. Acidità, acqua e dolcezza dei pomodori variano. Annota acqua aggiunta e rivedi resa; per aceto di Jerez al posto di quello rosso verifica etichetta e ricalcola, senza assumere la stessa scheda USDA. Omettere il pane o usarlo senza glutine cambia formula e nutrizione, senza garantire consistenza equivalente. Contiene frumento/glutine; controlla anche latte, uovo o tracce del pane e solfiti dell’aceto. Lava verdure sotto acqua corrente senza sapone prima del taglio, pulisci mani e utensili ed evita contaminazione da carne o uovo crudi. Zuppa di verdure crude non pastorizzata: il lavaggio non elimina tutti i microrganismi e l’aceto non garantisce sicurezza. Refrigera subito a 4 °C o meno. Proposta domestica di qualità non testata: consuma in giornata o entro 24 ore con freddo continuo; conserva zuppa e guarnizione separate e usa utensili puliti. Non riutilizzare avanzi del piatto né prolungare conservazione perché ha buon odore. Il congelamento può separare l’emulsione e alterare le verdure; non si stabilisce durata congelata verificata. Nutrizione stimata con dieci alimenti USDA esatti, formula e guarnizione intere divise per quattro; marche e misurazioni reali cambiano i valori.</p>"},{"id":"35d2dd2d-49c5-5d08-9718-0269af0246ec","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"ガスパチョ","public_path":"/ja/ガスパチョ","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ","excerpt":"トマト、きゅうり、ピーマン、パンで作る冷たいガスパチョ。材料を分類し、付け合わせも分量に含め、冷却時間とUSDAに基づく推定栄養値を示します。","summary":"生のトマトと野菜、水で戻したパン、オリーブ油、赤ワインビネガーを使う、加熱も裏ごしもしない冷たいガスパチョです。提案は4人分で、付け合わせは計量した野菜から取り分けます。冷却120分を含む合計145分。分量、出来上がり量、時間は調理試験での確認前です。","category":"スープ・ポタージュ","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"初級","course":"冷たいスープ","cuisine":"スペイン料理","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"熟した赤い生トマト（へたを除いて計量）","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"皮付きの生きゅうり（洗って両端を除く）","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"緑の甘いピーマン（へたと種を除く）","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"皮をむいた玉ねぎ","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"皮をむいたにんにく","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"野菜"},{"name":"焼いてある白いパン（具やカビのないもの）","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ベースと調味料"},{"name":"オリーブ油","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ベースと調味料"},{"name":"赤ワインビネガー","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"ベースと調味料"},{"name":"冷たい飲用水","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"ベースと調味料"},{"name":"細かい塩","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"ベースと調味料"}],"steps":[{"title":"野菜を洗い、確認して計量する","content":"手を洗い、清潔なまな板、包丁、ボウル、はかり、ミキサーを用意し、生肉や生卵用の道具と分けます。トマト、きゅうり、ピーマンを流水で洗い、石けんは使いません。きゅうりをこすり、切る前に清潔な布で水気を拭きます。腐ったものは捨てます。へたや端を除き、ピーマンのへたと種を取り除きます。その後トマト800 g、皮付ききゅうり150 g、ピーマン100 g、皮をむいた玉ねぎ40 g、にんにく4 gを量ります。生で食べる料理で、洗浄は殺菌ではありません。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 野菜を洗い、確認して計量する"},{"title":"パンを戻し、付け合わせを取り分ける","content":"焼いてあるパン40 gをボウルにちぎり、冷水120 gを注ぎます。10分柔らかくし、水はすべて残します。その間にトマト40 g、きゅうり20 g、ピーマン20 gを小さい角切りにし、盛り付け用としてふた付き容器に取ります。付け合わせは4 °C以下で冷蔵します。残りのトマト760 g、きゅうり130 g、ピーマン80 gと玉ねぎ、にんにくをミキサー用に切ります。パンを戻す時間と切る作業は重なるため、合計時間に再加算しません。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: パンを戻し、付け合わせを取り分ける"},{"title":"裏ごしせずにベースを撹拌する","content":"ベース用トマト760 g、きゅうり130 g、ピーマン80 g、玉ねぎ40 g、にんにく4 g、パンと戻し水の全量をミキサーに入れます。酢20 gと塩4 gを加えます。ふたを閉め、約2分または大きな塊がなくなるまで撹拌します。最大容量を守り、必要なら数回に分けます。へらで内側を集める前に停止して電源プラグを抜きます。トマトの皮や種を除かず、後からこしません。この配合はそれらを残します。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 裏ごしせずにベースを撹拌する"},{"title":"計量した油で乳化させる","content":"撹拌したベースにオリーブ油40 gを加え、約1分さらに撹拌し、均一でややクリーミーにします。器具の説明に従い、運転中に油を加えられない機種は停止し、加えてふたを閉めてから再び撹拌します。分量外の油、水、氷、パンは足しません。この提案では計量した濃度と調味を保ちます。後の変更は記録して栄養値を再計算します。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 計量した油で乳化させる"},{"title":"付け合わせと分けてすぐ冷蔵する","content":"ガスパチョ全量を清潔で浅い容器に移し、ふたをしてすぐ4 °C以下で冷蔵します。全体が十分冷たくなるまで、目安として120分冷やします。必要なら延ばし、合計時間に加えます。付け合わせもふたをして冷蔵します。酢は冷蔵の代わりにならず、不適切に保存した料理を安全にもしません。先に作業台へ置いて冷ますことはしません。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 付け合わせと分けてすぐ冷蔵する"},{"title":"混ぜて追加材料なしで分ける","content":"食べる直前に取り出し、清潔なスプーンで混ぜて分離した層を戻します。スープ全量を4個の器に均等に分けます。計量した付け合わせを4等分し、各器にトマト10 g、きゅうり5 g、ピーマン5 gをのせます。油、パン、卵、ハーブを追加しません。この配合には含まれていません。すぐ食べない分は冷やしたままにします。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 混ぜて追加材料なしで分ける"},{"title":"冷たく出し、残りを保存する","content":"一人に4人分のうち一人分を出します。提案の合計は145分です。準備25分には野菜を切る間のパンの戻し10分が含まれ、冷却120分を加えます。加熱工程はありません。材料の合計1418 gは生の配合重量で、測った完成重量ではありません。出来上がり量と時間は調理試験での確認前です。未試験の家庭向け品質提案として、できれば当日または24時間以内に食べ、常にふた付きで4 °C以下に保ちます。器の食べ残しを保存容器へ戻しません。","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"野菜とパンのスペイン伝統ガスパチョ: 冷たく出し、残りを保存する"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"熟した赤い生トマト（へたを除いて計量）","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮付きの生きゅうり（洗って両端を除く）","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"緑の甘いピーマン（へたと種を除く）","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいた玉ねぎ","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいたにんにく","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"焼いてある白いパン（具やカビのないもの）","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"オリーブ油","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"赤ワインビネガー","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"冷たい飲用水","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"細かい塩","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"計量したスープと付け合わせの四分の一。完成重量は未確認","method":"トマト800 g、皮付ききゅうり150 g、緑のピーマン100 g、玉ねぎ40 g、にんにく4 g、パン40 g、油40 g、赤ワインビネガー20 g、水120 g、塩4 gの栄養量を合算し4で割ります。付け合わせはこの分量に含まれ、別に加算しません。裏ごしや架空の損失はありません。","note":"配合の推定値で、検査室の分析や調理結果ではありません。十種類の正確なUSDA SR Legacy食品で八項目の栄養値を確認し、欠測をゼロで補っていません。きゅうりの皮、パン全量、トマトの皮と種、調味料全量を含み、銘柄、残り、出来上がり量で変わります。1418 gは材料の合計で、測定した完成重量ではありません。"},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"白い器の赤みのあるオレンジ色の冷たいガスパチョに、トマト、皮付ききゅうり、緑のピーマンの小さい角切りをのせた様子"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["ガスパチョ","スペインの冷製スープ","冷たいトマトスープ","パン入りガスパチョ"],"notes":"トマト、皮付ききゅうり、緑のピーマン、玉ねぎ、にんにく、パン、油、赤ワインビネガーによる独自の冷たいガスパチョの提案です。分量、四人分、濃度、時間は調理試験による確認前で、試験済みや完成重量の測定済みとは記載しません。トマトの皮と種、パンの戻し水をすべて残し、こさないため栄養損失を創作しません。付け合わせは計量した野菜から取り、追加の油やパンはありません。傷みのない熟したトマトと、焼いてある具なしのパンを使います。カビのあるパンは見える部分だけ切らず廃棄します。トマトの酸味、水分、甘味は変わります。水を追加する場合は記録して出来上がり量を見直します。シェリービネガーに替えるなら表示を確認して再計算し、赤ワインビネガーと同じUSDA食品とみなしません。パンを抜く、またはグルテンフリーパンに替えると配合と栄養値が変わり、同じ濃度は保証しません。小麦・グルテンを含み、パンによって乳、卵、微量成分、酢によって亜硫酸塩の表示も確認します。切る前に石けんを使わず流水で野菜を洗い、手と器具を清潔にし、生肉や生卵との交差汚染を避けます。非加熱・非殺菌の野菜スープで、洗浄はすべての微生物を除かず、酢も安全を保証しません。すぐ4 °C以下で冷蔵します。未試験の家庭向け品質提案として、冷蔵を途切れさせず当日または24時間以内に食べ、スープと付け合わせを分けて保存し清潔な道具を使います。器の残りを戻したり、よい匂いを理由に保存を延ばしたりしません。冷凍は乳化の分離や野菜の変化を起こす可能性があり、確認済みの冷凍保存期間は設定しません。栄養値は十種類の確認済みUSDA食品による全配合と付け合わせを四等分した推定値です。パン、油、酢の銘柄や実測値で変わります。","seo":{"title":"スペイン伝統ガスパチョの作り方","description":"トマト、きゅうり、ピーマン、パンの冷たいガスパチョ。付け合わせも計量し、冷却時間と推定栄養値を記載。調理試験前の提案配合です。","image_alt":"白い器の赤みのあるオレンジ色の冷たいガスパチョに、トマト、皮付ききゅうり、緑のピーマンの小さい角切りをのせた様子","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"こしたり、すべての皮をむいたりしますか？","a":"この配合ではトマトの皮と種、洗ったきゅうりの皮を残します。十分撹拌してこさず、量った可食部すべてを栄養計算に含めます。固形物を除く場合は出来上がり量と栄養値が変わるので記録し、具体的な損失を仮定しません。"},{"q":"付け合わせや油を別に加算しますか？","a":"いいえ。総量からトマト40 g、きゅうり20 g、ピーマン20 gを取り分け、4人分に分けます。油40 gはスープに使い、追加の油はありません。パンを戻す水120 gもすべて残します。"},{"q":"何分かかり、冷蔵でいつまでですか？","a":"準備25分と冷却120分の合計145分を提案します。まだ冷たくなければ延ばします。加熱工程も確認済みの調理試験もありません。すぐ4 °C以下で冷蔵し、未確認の家庭向け品質提案として当日または24時間以内に食べます。酢は冷蔵の代わりにはなりません。"}]},"content_html":"<p>生のトマトと野菜、水で戻したパン、オリーブ油、赤ワインビネガーを使う、加熱も裏ごしもしない冷たいガスパチョです。提案は4人分で、付け合わせは計量した野菜から取り分けます。冷却120分を含む合計145分。分量、出来上がり量、時間は調理試験での確認前です。</p><p>トマト、皮付ききゅうり、緑のピーマン、玉ねぎ、にんにく、パン、油、赤ワインビネガーによる独自の冷たいガスパチョの提案です。分量、四人分、濃度、時間は調理試験による確認前で、試験済みや完成重量の測定済みとは記載しません。トマトの皮と種、パンの戻し水をすべて残し、こさないため栄養損失を創作しません。付け合わせは計量した野菜から取り、追加の油やパンはありません。傷みのない熟したトマトと、焼いてある具なしのパンを使います。カビのあるパンは見える部分だけ切らず廃棄します。トマトの酸味、水分、甘味は変わります。水を追加する場合は記録して出来上がり量を見直します。シェリービネガーに替えるなら表示を確認して再計算し、赤ワインビネガーと同じUSDA食品とみなしません。パンを抜く、またはグルテンフリーパンに替えると配合と栄養値が変わり、同じ濃度は保証しません。小麦・グルテンを含み、パンによって乳、卵、微量成分、酢によって亜硫酸塩の表示も確認します。切る前に石けんを使わず流水で野菜を洗い、手と器具を清潔にし、生肉や生卵との交差汚染を避けます。非加熱・非殺菌の野菜スープで、洗浄はすべての微生物を除かず、酢も安全を保証しません。すぐ4 °C以下で冷蔵します。未試験の家庭向け品質提案として、冷蔵を途切れさせず当日または24時間以内に食べ、スープと付け合わせを分けて保存し清潔な道具を使います。器の残りを戻したり、よい匂いを理由に保存を延ばしたりしません。冷凍は乳化の分離や野菜の変化を起こす可能性があり、確認済みの冷凍保存期間は設定しません。栄養値は十種類の確認済みUSDA食品による全配合と付け合わせを四等分した推定値です。パン、油、酢の銘柄や実測値で変わります。</p>"},{"id":"b8b25aac-f6ea-56cc-b4fa-b79ee394aa85","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"gazpacho-tradicional","public_path":"/pt/gazpacho-tradicional","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão","excerpt":"Gazpacho frio de tomate com pepino, pimentão e pão: quantidades agrupadas, guarnição incluída, resfriamento completo e nutrição estimada com fichas USDA.","summary":"Gazpacho frio de tomate e legumes crus, pão demolhado, azeite e vinagre de vinho tinto, sem cozimento nem peneira. A proposta rende 4 porções com guarnição retirada dos legumes pesados e leva 145 minutos, incluindo 120 de resfriamento; quantidades, rendimento e tempos aguardam testes de cozinha.","category":"Sopas e cremes","category_slug":"sopas-y-cremas","difficulty":"Fácil","course":"Sopa fria","cuisine":"Espanhola","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":0,"total_time_minutes":145,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"tomate vermelho maduro cru, pesado sem pedúnculo","amount":"800","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"pepino cru com casca, lavado e sem pontas","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"pimentão verde doce, sem talo nem sementes","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"cebola descascada","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"alho descascado","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Legumes"},{"name":"pão branco já assado, sem recheio nem mofo","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base e tempero"},{"name":"azeite de oliva","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Base e tempero"},{"name":"vinagre de vinho tinto","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Base e tempero"},{"name":"água potável fria","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Base e tempero"},{"name":"sal fino","amount":"4","unit":"g","group":"Base e tempero"}],"steps":[{"title":"Lave, confira e pese os legumes","content":"Lave as mãos e prepare tábua, faca, tigela, balança e liquidificador limpos, separados dos utensílios de carne ou ovo crus. Lave tomates, pepino e pimentão em água corrente, sem sabão; esfregue o pepino e seque com pano limpo antes de cortar. Descarte peças podres. Retire pedúnculos e pontas; tire talo e sementes do pimentão. Pese depois 800 g de tomate, 150 g de pepino com casca, 100 g de pimentão, 40 g de cebola descascada e 4 g de alho descascado. A receita é consumida crua: lavar não esteriliza.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Lave, confira e pese os legumes"},{"title":"Demolhe o pão e reserve a guarnição","content":"Rasgue os 40 g de pão já assado numa tigela e despeje os 120 g de água fria. Deixe amolecer por 10 minutos; conserve toda a água. Enquanto isso, corte e reserve 40 g de tomate, 20 g de pepino e 20 g de pimentão em cubinhos num recipiente tampado para servir. Refrigere essa guarnição a 4 °C ou menos. Corte para o liquidificador os 760 g de tomate, 130 g de pepino e 80 g de pimentão restantes, junto com cebola e alho. O demolho acontece junto do corte e não é somado outra vez ao tempo total.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Demolhe o pão e reserve a guarnição"},{"title":"Bata a base sem peneirar","content":"Coloque no copo os 760 g de tomate, 130 g de pepino e 80 g de pimentão da base, os 40 g de cebola, os 4 g de alho e todo o pão com sua água. Acrescente os 20 g de vinagre e os 4 g de sal. Tampe e bata cerca de 2 minutos, ou até não restarem pedaços grandes; respeite a capacidade máxima e trabalhe em etapas se necessário. Pare e tire da tomada antes de raspar com uma espátula. Não retire cascas ou sementes do tomate nem peneire depois: esta fórmula as conserva.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Bata a base sem peneirar"},{"title":"Emulsione com o azeite medido","content":"Acrescente os 40 g de azeite à base batida e bata por cerca de 1 minuto mais, até ficar uniforme e levemente cremosa. Siga as instruções do aparelho; se não permitir acrescentar azeite em funcionamento, pare, acrescente, tampe e bata novamente. Não adicione azeite, água, gelo nem pão além das quantidades. Esta proposta mantém textura e tempero medidos; mudanças posteriores devem ser anotadas e a nutrição recalculada.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Emulsione com o azeite medido"},{"title":"Resfrie imediatamente com guarnição separada","content":"Passe todo o gazpacho para recipientes limpos e rasos, tampe e refrigere imediatamente a 4 °C ou menos. Resfrie por 120 minutos como referência, até toda a mistura estar fria; prolongue se precisar e some ao total. Conserve a guarnição também tampada e refrigerada. Vinagre não substitui refrigeração nem torna segura uma sopa mal conservada. Não deixe primeiro a sopa na bancada para esfriar.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Resfrie imediatamente com guarnição separada"},{"title":"Mexa e divida sem novos ingredientes","content":"Retire o gazpacho só para servir e mexa com colher limpa para unir possíveis camadas separadas. Divida toda a sopa igualmente em 4 tigelas. Distribua a guarnição medida em 4 partes, cada uma com 10 g de tomate, 5 g de pepino e 5 g de pimentão, e coloque por cima. Não acrescente fios de azeite, pão, ovo nem ervas extras: não fazem parte desta fórmula. Mantenha refrigeradas as porções não consumidas imediatamente.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Mexa e divida sem novos ingredientes"},{"title":"Sirva frio e guarde o restante","content":"Sirva uma das 4 porções por pessoa. A proposta completa leva 145 minutos: 25 de preparo, incluindo o demolho de 10 enquanto se cortam legumes, e 120 de resfriamento; não há cozimento. A soma dos ingredientes é 1418 g crus, não um peso final medido; rendimento e tempos aguardam teste de cozinha. Como proposta doméstica de qualidade sem ensaio, consuma preferencialmente no mesmo dia ou em até 24 horas, sempre tampado a 4 °C ou menos, sem devolver sobras do prato ao recipiente.","image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","image_alt":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol com legumes e pão: Sirva frio e guarde o restante"}],"nutrition":{"calories":168.1,"protein_g":3.3,"carbs_g":16.5,"fat_g":10.8,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"fiber_g":3.5,"sugar_g":7.5,"sodium_mg":451,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"tomate vermelho maduro cru, pesado sem pedúnculo","edible_grams":800,"fdc_id":170457,"fdc_description":"Tomatoes, red, ripe, raw, year round average","per_100g":{"calories":18,"protein_g":0.88,"carbs_g":3.89,"fat_g":0.2,"saturated_fat_g":0.028,"fiber_g":1.2,"sugar_g":2.63,"sodium_mg":5},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pepino cru com casca, lavado e sem pontas","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":168409,"fdc_description":"Cucumber, with peel, raw","per_100g":{"calories":15,"protein_g":0.65,"carbs_g":3.63,"fat_g":0.11,"saturated_fat_g":0.037,"fiber_g":0.5,"sugar_g":1.67,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168409/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimentão verde doce, sem talo nem sementes","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"calories":20,"protein_g":0.86,"carbs_g":4.64,"fat_g":0.17,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":2.4,"sodium_mg":3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebola descascada","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"calories":40,"protein_g":1.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"fat_g":0.1,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"fiber_g":1.7,"sugar_g":4.24,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"alho descascado","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":169230,"fdc_description":"Garlic, raw","per_100g":{"calories":149,"protein_g":6.36,"carbs_g":33.1,"fat_g":0.5,"saturated_fat_g":0.089,"fiber_g":2.1,"sugar_g":1,"sodium_mg":17},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169230/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pão branco já assado, sem recheio nem mofo","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":174924,"fdc_description":"Bread, white, commercially prepared (includes soft bread crumbs)","per_100g":{"calories":266,"protein_g":8.85,"carbs_g":49.4,"fat_g":3.33,"saturated_fat_g":0.698,"fiber_g":2.7,"sugar_g":5.67,"sodium_mg":490},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174924/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"azeite de oliva","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":171413,"fdc_description":"Oil, olive, salad or cooking","per_100g":{"calories":884,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":13.8,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":2},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171413/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinagre de vinho tinto","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":172240,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, red wine","per_100g":{"calories":19,"protein_g":0.04,"carbs_g":0.27,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172240/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"água potável fria","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":173647,"fdc_description":"Beverages, water, tap, drinking","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173647/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sal fino","edible_grams":4,"fdc_id":173468,"fdc_description":"Salt, table","per_100g":{"calories":0,"protein_g":0,"carbs_g":0,"fat_g":0,"saturated_fat_g":0,"fiber_g":0,"sugar_g":0,"sodium_mg":38800},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173468/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Um quarto da sopa e guarnição medidas; sem peso final confirmado","method":"Some nutrientes de 800 g de tomate, 150 g de pepino com casca, 100 g de pimentão verde, 40 g de cebola, 4 g de alho, 40 g de pão, 40 g de azeite, 20 g de vinagre de vinho tinto, 120 g de água e 4 g de sal; divida por 4. A guarnição vem dessas quantidades, sem soma à parte. Não há peneira nem perdas inventadas.","note":"Estimativa de formulação, não análise de laboratório nem resultado de cozinha. Dez fichas USDA SR Legacy exatas com oito nutrientes presentes, sem preencher ausências com zero. Inclui casca do pepino, todo o pão, cascas e sementes do tomate e todo o tempero; marcas, sobras e rendimento mudam os valores. Os 1418 g são soma dos ingredientes, não peso final medido."},"image_url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","gallery":[{"url":"/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada.webp","alt":"Gazpacho frio vermelho alaranjado numa tigela branca com cubinhos de tomate, pepino com casca e pimentão verde"}],"published":true,"editorial_status":"published","keywords":["gazpacho tradicional","gazpacho espanhol","sopa fria de tomate","gazpacho com pão"],"notes":"Proposta original de gazpacho frio de tomate, pepino com casca, pimentão verde, cebola, alho, pão, azeite e vinagre de vinho tinto. Quantidades, quatro porções, textura e tempos aguardam testes de cozinha; não se afirma ensaio nem peso final. Conserva cascas e sementes do tomate e toda a água do pão; sem peneirar, não inventa perdas de nutrientes. A guarnição vem dos legumes já pesados, sem azeite ou pão extras. Use tomates maduros em bom estado e pão já assado sem recheio; descarte pão com mofo, não corte só a área visível. Acidez, água e doçura dos tomates variam. Anote água extra e revise rendimento; substituir vinagre tinto por Jerez exige identificar o rótulo e recalcular, sem supor a mesma ficha USDA. Omitir pão ou usar pão sem glúten muda fórmula e nutrição, sem prometer textura equivalente. Contém trigo/glúten; confira leite, ovo ou traços conforme o pão e sulfitos conforme o vinagre. Lave em água corrente sem sabão antes do corte, limpe mãos e utensílios e evite contaminação cruzada com carne ou ovo crus. Sopa de legumes crus não pasteurizada: lavar não elimina todos os microrganismos e vinagre não garante segurança. Refrigere logo a 4 °C ou menos. Como proposta doméstica de qualidade não testada, consuma no mesmo dia ou em até 24 horas com frio contínuo; guarde sopa e guarnição separadas e use utensílios limpos. Não reutilize sobras do prato nem prolongue por cheiro agradável. Congelar pode separar a emulsão e alterar os legumes; não se estabelece conservação congelada verificada. Nutrição estimada com dez alimentos USDA exatos, toda a fórmula e guarnição divididas por quatro; marcas e medidas reais alteram os valores.","seo":{"title":"Gazpacho tradicional espanhol: receita completa","description":"Gazpacho frio com tomate, pepino, pimentão e pão. Guarnição medida, resfriamento completo e nutrição estimada; quantidades propostas sem teste de cozinha.","image_alt":"Gazpacho frio vermelho alaranjado numa tigela branca com cubinhos de tomate, pepino com casca e pimentão verde","image_variants":["/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Preciso peneirar ou descascar tudo?","a":"Esta fórmula conserva cascas e sementes do tomate e casca lavada do pepino. Bata bem e não peneire: a estimativa conta toda a parte comestível pesada. Retirar sólidos muda rendimento e nutrição e deve ser registrado, sem supor perda específica."},{"q":"Guarnição e azeite são somados à parte?","a":"Não. Reserve 40 g de tomate, 20 g de pepino e 20 g de pimentão dos totais e divida entre 4 porções. Os 40 g de azeite vão na sopa, sem fio extra. O pão é demolhado nos 120 g de água, também conservados."},{"q":"Quanto tempo leva e quanto dura na geladeira?","a":"Propõem-se 145 minutos, 25 de preparo e 120 de resfriamento; prolongue se ainda não estiver frio. Não há cozimento nem teste confirmado. Refrigere imediatamente a 4 °C ou menos e, como proposta doméstica de qualidade não verificada, consuma no mesmo dia ou em até 24 horas. Vinagre não substitui a cadeia de frio."}]},"content_html":"<p>Gazpacho frio de tomate e legumes crus, pão demolhado, azeite e vinagre de vinho tinto, sem cozimento nem peneira. A proposta rende 4 porções com guarnição retirada dos legumes pesados e leva 145 minutos, incluindo 120 de resfriamento; quantidades, rendimento e tempos aguardam testes de cozinha.</p><p>Proposta original de gazpacho frio de tomate, pepino com casca, pimentão verde, cebola, alho, pão, azeite e vinagre de vinho tinto. Quantidades, quatro porções, textura e tempos aguardam testes de cozinha; não se afirma ensaio nem peso final. Conserva cascas e sementes do tomate e toda a água do pão; sem peneirar, não inventa perdas de nutrientes. A guarnição vem dos legumes já pesados, sem azeite ou pão extras. Use tomates maduros em bom estado e pão já assado sem recheio; descarte pão com mofo, não corte só a área visível. Acidez, água e doçura dos tomates variam. Anote água extra e revise rendimento; substituir vinagre tinto por Jerez exige identificar o rótulo e recalcular, sem supor a mesma ficha USDA. Omitir pão ou usar pão sem glúten muda fórmula e nutrição, sem prometer textura equivalente. Contém trigo/glúten; confira leite, ovo ou traços conforme o pão e sulfitos conforme o vinagre. Lave em água corrente sem sabão antes do corte, limpe mãos e utensílios e evite contaminação cruzada com carne ou ovo crus. Sopa de legumes crus não pasteurizada: lavar não elimina todos os microrganismos e vinagre não garante segurança. Refrigere logo a 4 °C ou menos. Como proposta doméstica de qualidade não testada, consuma no mesmo dia ou em até 24 horas com frio contínuo; guarde sopa e guarnição separadas e use utensílios limpos. Não reutilize sobras do prato nem prolongue por cheiro agradável. Congelar pode separar a emulsão e alterar os legumes; não se estabelece conservação congelada verificada. Nutrição estimada com dez alimentos USDA exatos, toda a fórmula e guarnição divididas por quatro; marcas e medidas reais alteram os valores.</p>"}]$records$::jsonb;
 b constant jsonb := $before${"id":"6f5ad062-368f-4c0a-b615-ae563017fec4","recipe_group_id":"eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e","slug":"gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","public_path":"/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/gazpacho-tradicional-espanol/","created_at":"2026-09-23 20:50:30.371317+00","published_at":"2026-09-23 20:50:30.371317+00","expected_row_md5":"88b4299436ba76cde13ea401d6be898d"}$before$::jsonb;
 g constant uuid := 'eedda558-8253-4132-b009-e59f6569026e';
 outside_checksum text;
 es_count int;
 n int;
